Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 04:53:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fig. 3 (b): wider panel, detector label along its line at
 1e-4 s

Panel (a) takes 0.56 of the width by default (was 0.68). The detector label
sits just under its line at 1e-4 s, turned to the line's slope on the plot;
the lambda+angle label moves to 8 s.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01NLfEqncaEw1RGMDLUGdFgb
